{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56035","headline":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 委（《天圣广灯录》作「迂」）曲商量 · 缘密","name":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 委（《天圣广灯录》作「迂」）曲商量","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得用由来处处通，归机施设认家风。\n扬眉瞬目同（《天圣广灯录》作「开」）一眼，竪拂敲牀爲耳聋。\n（以上十二首均见《大正藏》第四十七册及《古尊宿语录》卷十八收宋守坚辑《云门匡真禅师广录》卷下。\n《天圣广灯录》卷二十一以爲鼎州普安道禅师作，道禅师爲缘密之法嗣。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缘密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}